WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.489
Kaplansky's zero divisors exist.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.767
Kaplansky asked if a torsion-free group algebra

3
00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:08.433
can have zero divisors; most expected not.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.337
In the product, every group element appears

5
00:00:11.337 --> 00:00:13.573
an even number of times: it cancels.

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.423
Claimed: two nonzero elements whose product is zero.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.427
Main theorem Lean-checked.
